1 OCCU Road Maintenence Worker
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''1909''' Ole Erling was born on February 20, 1909 on Vatvedt in Degernes. His parents were Johan Albert Olsen, born in 1886 and Maria Johansdatter, born in 1884. He was baptized on April 18, 1909 in Degernes kirk
2 CONC e. Godparents were Fuldmæktig A. Murtnes and wife Inga Andersdatter, farmer-wife Sofie Olsdatter Julsrudplass, and worker Ludvig Olsen Julsrudplass. Source information: Østfold county, Degernes in Rakkestad, Parish register (offic
2 CONC ial) nr. II 2 (1900-1920), Birth and baptism records 1909, page 33. no. 8, http://www.arkivverket.no/URN:NBN:no-a1450-kb20060627080251.jpg
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1910''' The following persons lived on Paaland Farm under Vestby at the 1910 census: 1. Albert Antonsen (24) Father, Farmer- owner, Married                  2. Marie Johannesdatter (26) Mother, House and Barn keeper, Married 3.
2 CONC  Johannes Johansen (5) Son 4. Astrid Otilie Johansen (4) Daughter 5. Ole Erling Johansen (1) Son 6. Gudrun Marie Johansen (newborn) Daughter  Source information: http://digitalarkivet.arkivverket.no/ft/person/pf01036353003423
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1923''' Ole Erling Berger was confirmed in Degernes kirke September 30, 1923 when he was 14 years old. The church record indicates that he lived on Sveen Farm, Degernes with his parents at the time of his confirmation. Source i
2 CONC nformation: Østfold county, Degernes in Rakkestad, Parish register (official) nr. II 3 (1920-1940), Confirmation records 1923, page 89, no 25. http://www.arkivverket.no/URN:NBN:no-a1450-kb10040910130091.jpg
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1936''' Ole Erling Berger, farmworker on Heller in Degernes and Solveig Pinås, living at Solberg, Borgenhaugen, got married at Hafslund kapell November 21, 1936 at 5:00 pm.                                                       
2 CONC                                                                                                 Permission was given by the fathers Albert Berger, Borregaard worker, Skolegata 75, Sarpsborg and Kristian Pinås, Borregaard worker, S
2 CONC olberg, Borgenhaugen, Skjeberg. Source information: Østfold county, Hafslund in Skjeberg, Banns register nr. Hc 0001 (1919-1949), Banns records 1936, page 58, no. 33.                                                                
2 CONC                                                                                                                            http://www.arkivverket.no/URN:NBN:no-a1450-kb20060327010728.jpg  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1966''' Ole Erling Berger died May 4, 1966 at Solberg, Degernes at age 57 and was buried at Degernes kirke.                                                                                                                        
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Notes by Egil Berger'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Ole Erling moved a lot; 1909 - Lived on Vatvedt in Degernes (when he was born)                                                                                    1910 - Lived on Paaland in Degernes (when his sister Gudrun was born
2 CONC )                                                             1913 - Lived on Berger in Degernes (when his brother Leif was born)                                                          1915 - Lived on Julsrudplass in Degernes (w
2 CONC hen his sister Solveig was born)                                                1917 - Lived on Nygaard in Degernes (when his sister Ruth was born)                                                              1919 - Lived on Heier
2 CONC ødegaard in Degernes (when his brother Johan was born)                                       1923 – Lived on Sveen (when he was confirmed)                                                                                            
2 CONC        1930 – Lived at Bakkegata 11 in Sandesund, Sarpsborg (when his sister Astrid got married)                  1939 – Lived on Nordby, Degernes (before his children were born)                                                    
2 CONC                               1940 – Lived on Haugstad, Degernes (when his son Egil was born)                                                                      1943 – Lived on Storeheier, Degernes (when his son John was born)  
2 CONC                                                                 1949 – Lived on Sagaveien, Degernes (when his father built his new house)                                                       1951 – Lived on Solberg,  Degernes unt
2 CONC il his death in  1966.  Erling’s siblings Arthur, Astrid, and Leif stayed in Sarpsborg and Degernes, while Solveig, Ruth, Gudrun and Johan moved to Oslo. My grandfather later (in the 1940’s) rented a smaller house at his sister He
2 CONC lvine Kristiansen’s home in Degernes.  I remember visiting him there between 1945-1950.  The place smelled strongly of stale tobacco. My parents rented a room on Helvine’s second floor, where I was born in 1940. 
